      <p class="text-gray-300">ServerPeacock is an independent Dutch-registered VPS provider founded in 2018, focused on the EU mid-market. The pitch is straightforward: KVM virtualization, IPv6 on every plan, four datacenters across the EU and US, and privacy-friendly billing that includes direct-wallet crypto (BTC, ETH, LTC, XMR) with no third-party processor. EUR pricing from €3.99/mo puts it in the same bracket as BuyVM's $3.50/mo slice — slightly higher raw price but with different defaults (IPv6-first, no Bandwidth billing surprises, EU-headquartered).</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Entry: €3.99/mo · KVM-2: €6.99/mo · KVM-4: €14.99/mo · IPv6 included</p>
